Dear Koichi,

I am sending Ishikawa's draft of the fourteen tables ahead of our review on 16 September at 14:00. =
It uses the 2 September 09:00 record cutoff; the tables are together in the attached workbook, vers=
ion 0.1.

Could we look at whether each denominator in the table heading agrees with the number eligible in t=
he summary rows? I would also appreciate your checking the units as we go: some tables count partic=
ipants, while the query tables count issued query rows. We should keep recorded zero, missing recor=
ds and records outside an item's eligibility separate.

We can work through any discrepancies together at the meeting. Thank you for taking a look.

Best regards,
Mitsuko Suzuki
Katsuragawa Clinical Research Center

